  "description": "Which event names an AGENT (the chat stream, a live push) may dispatch onto a renderer. The built-in ones always; any other only when a component on screen declares it (an OnCustomEvent trigger: @SubscribeTo) and it is not one of the framework's own event names. Read by libs/mateu agentEventPolicy.test.ts and Redwood test-chat-events.mjs. A design-system widget's own event names (vaadin `*-changed`, dialog `confirm`/`cancel`, JET `oj…`) are reserved too: none is reachable today (they are listened on descendants), it is insurance; an author's own `booking-changed` stays dispatchable.",
